The 29 rows in `data/data.jsonl` whose `source` field is `mooncake_fast25_trace` are
DERIVED from the Mooncake conversation trace: each row records a first-touch prefill
accounting quantity computed over one workload of that trace. The rows are aggregates
and contain no prompt text, no response text, and no conversation content.

The 36 rows whose `source` is `synthetic_ramp` are our own and are not derived from
Mooncake.

If you redistribute the derived rows, carry this attribution with them.
